      "definition": "Locator index for urn:stdo:bounded-context:world-model, declared at WORLD_MODEL §2. Builder Project, Published Domain Artifact, World Model Object, Markov Object, Treatment Surface, Covariance Edge, Adjoint Mapping, Composed World Model and Query Plane are owned at WORLD_MODEL.md#6-units. Builder Project additionally routes to #builder-project-specialisation and Markov Object to #4-the-markov-object-construct; the other seven rows list no relation clause. These are indexed identities, not definitions supplied by this excerpt.",
